---
// EthicsLopsidedCosts: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="elc">
  <div class="elc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two cost cards: missing one bad case costs real money or safety, rejecting a good customer costs one small sale. Both push the cutoff toward no, which leaves many safe people stuck outside.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Why a risk score leans toward "no"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao điểm rủi ro nghiêng về "từ chối"</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Two mistakes, two very different bills for the institution.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai kiểu sai, hai hóa đơn rất khác nhau với tổ chức.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="70" width="410" height="96" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={50} y={104} size={30} />
      <text x="80" y="98" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Miss one bad case (false negative)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bỏ lọt một ca xấu (âm tính giả)</tspan></text>
      <text x="80" y="118" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Real money or safety is lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mất tiền thật hoặc mất an toàn</tspan></text>
      <rect x="80" y="134" width="320" height="12" rx="3" class="bar" />
      <rect x="470" y="70" width="410" height="96" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={500} y={104} size={30} />
      <text x="530" y="98" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Reject a good customer (false positive)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Từ chối nhầm khách tốt (dương tính giả)</tspan></text>
      <text x="530" y="118" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>One small sale is lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mất một đơn hàng nhỏ</tspan></text>
      <rect x="530" y="134" width="64" height="12" rx="3" class="box" />
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 225 166 L 375.2 204.8" /><polygon points="380,206 373.1,207.4 374.7,201.5" /></g>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 675 166 L 524.8 204.8" /><polygon points="520,206 525.3,201.5 526.9,207.4" /></g>
      <rect x="250" y="206" width="400" height="50" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={284} y={231} size={28} />
      <text x="314" y="236" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>The cutoff drifts toward "no"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngưỡng trôi dần về "từ chối"</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 450 256 L 450.0 271.0" /><polygon points="450,276 447.0,269.7 453.0,269.7" /></g>
      <rect x="250" y="276" width="400" height="42" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="users" x={284} y={297} size={26} />
      <text x="314" y="302" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Many safe people stay outside</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhiều người an toàn bị chặn ngoài</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The institution only feels the left bill, so the cutoff drifts toward "no". The weights drawn here are illustrative, not measured.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tổ chức chỉ thấy hóa đơn bên trái, nên ngưỡng trôi dần về phía "từ chối". Độ dài thanh chỉ để minh họa, không phải số đo.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .elc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .elc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .elc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .elc text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .elc .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .elc .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .elc .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .elc .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .elc .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .elc .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .elc .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .elc .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .elc .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .elc .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .elc .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .elc .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .elc .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .elc .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .elc .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .elc .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .elc .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .elc .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .elc .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .elc .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .elc .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .elc .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .elc .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .elc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
